  "title": "Chunky Cinnamon-Orange Applesauce",
  "description": "Spiced chunky applesauce is flavored with cinnamon, nutmeg, orange juice, and lemon zest for a must-have accompaniment to holiday latkes. Serve it warm or chilled.",
